dhp13:1 starts: As rain seeps into
dhp13:2 starts: an ill-thatched hut,
dhp13:3 starts: so passion,
dhp13:4 starts: the undeveloped mind.
dhp14:1 starts: As rain doesn’t seep into
dhp14:2 starts: a well-thatched hut,
dhp14:3 starts: so passion does not,
dhp14:4 starts: the well-developed mind.
dhp5:1 starts: Hostilities aren’t stilled
dhp5:2 starts: through hostility,
dhp5:3 starts: Hostilities are stilled
dhp5:4 starts: this, an unending truth.
dhp9:1 starts: He who,
dhp9:2 starts: depraved,
dhp9:3 starts: devoid
dhp9:4 starts: puts on the ochre robe,
dhp10:1 starts: But he who is free
dhp10:2 starts: of depravity
dhp10:3 starts: endowed
dhp10:4 starts: truly deserves the ochre robe.
dhp26:1 starts: They’re addicted to heedlessness
dhp26:2 starts: –dullards, fools–
dhp26:3 starts: while one who is wise
dhp26:4 starts: as his highest wealth.
dhp30:1 starts: Through heedfulness, Indra won
dhp30:2 starts: to lordship over the devas.
dhp30:3 starts: Heedfulness is praised,
dhp30:4 starts: heedlessness censured–
dhp34:1 starts: Like a fish
dhp34:2 starts: pulled from its home in the water
dhp34:3 starts: this mind flips & flaps about
dhp34:4 starts: to escape Mara’s sway.
dhp42:1 starts: Whatever an enemy might do
dhp42:2 starts: to an enemy,
dhp42:3 starts: the ill-directed mind
dhp42:4 starts: can do to you
dhp43:1 starts: Whatever a mother, father
dhp43:2 starts: or other kinsman
dhp43:3 starts: the well-directed mind
dhp43:4 starts: can do for you
dhp47:1 starts: The man immersed in
dhp47:2 starts: his heart distracted:
dhp47:3 starts: as a great flood,
dhp47:4 starts: a village asleep.
dhp48:1 starts: The man immersed in
dhp48:2 starts: gathering blossoms,
dhp48:3 starts: his heart distracted,
dhp48:4 starts: the End-Maker holds him
dhp49:1 starts: As a bee–without harming
dhp49:2 starts: the blossom,
dhp49:3 starts: takes its nectar & flies away:
dhp49:4 starts: so should the sage
dhp50:1 starts: Focus,
dhp50:2 starts: not on what they’ve done
dhp50:3 starts: but on what you
dhp50:4 starts: have & haven’t done
dhp53:1 starts: Just as from a heap of flowers
dhp53:2 starts: many garland strands can be made,
dhp53:3 starts: even so
dhp53:4 starts: many a skillful thing.
